.TH HCC 1 "October 2026" "ALI Linux 1.4.8" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
hcc \- HolyC subset compiler: HolyC in, instant program out
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hcc prog.hc
.RI [ args... ]
.br
.B hcc \-o prog prog.hc
.SH DESCRIPTION
Translates the v1 HolyC subset (U0/U8..U64/I8..I64/F32/F64 types,
.BR Print (),
if/while/for/return, // comments, #include passthrough,
.B U0 Main
entry) to C and runs it at once through tcc (gcc fallback).
Grows holier every release; see
.I /usr/share/ali/examples/hello.hc
for the first program.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR tcc (1),
.BR gcc (1)
